{"fiche":"PANSEMENT","contenus":[{"id":"c9da7526-9a57-494a-acc1-5b56197d2a5e","racine_id":"c9da7526-9a57-494a-acc1-5b56197d2a5e","version":1,"type":"geste","titre":"Friction hydro-alcoolique des mains","resume":"Avant et après chaque soin, après le retrait des gants.","corps":{"etapes":[{"texte":"Retirer bagues, montre et bracelets ; ongles courts, sans vernis.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Déposer une dose de solution hydro-alcoolique qui remplit le creux de la main.","vigilance":"Mains visiblement souillées : lavage au savon doux d'abord, séchage complet, puis friction."},{"texte":"Frictionner paume contre paume, puis le dos de chaque main, doigts entrecroisés.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Frictionner le dos des doigts, les pouces, puis le bout des doigts et les ongles dans la paume opposée.","vigilance":null},{"texte":"Terminer par les poignets ; frictionner jusqu'à séchage complet, sans essuyer.","vigilance":"Une friction trop courte (moins de 20 à 30 secondes) laisse des zones non désinfectées."}],"materiel":["Solution hydro-alcoolique (flacon de poche)"]},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","le":"2026-10-19T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin","le":"2026-10-19","revision_le":"2027-10-19"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":4,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"ea635aef-e1f8-4afd-b5e8-85f7e9175e9d","racine_id":"ea635aef-e1f8-4afd-b5e8-85f7e9175e9d","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La friction hydro-alcoolique, comment ?","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:30","credit":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"IXiGWkMu27E"},"source":"Hôpitaux universitaires de Genève","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène","geste important"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-15T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-15","revision_le":"2027-10-15"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"cf6aa6e2-ecc5-410d-952c-24ba35de2247","racine_id":"cf6aa6e2-ecc5-410d-952c-24ba35de2247","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Quand appeler le médecin pour une plaie ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT"],"tags":["plaie","urgence"],"essentiel":true,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-21T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-21","revision_le":"2027-10-21"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"be622ff7-b1c3-4397-8b57-709f5ffd6581","texte":"Le jour même devant une rougeur ou une chaleur qui s'étend autour de la plaie, un écoulement purulent ou une odeur nouvelle, une fièvre, une douleur qui augmente, un saignement qui ne cède pas à dix minutes de compression. Sans urgence, signalez une plaie qui ne progresse pas sur deux semaines de pansements. Malaise, confusion ou frissons : appel du 15.","source":null,"auteur":{"nom":"Dr Hélène Marchand","qualite":"Médecin"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","validee":true,"validee_par":"Claire Martin, IDE","validee_le":"2026-10-21"}]},{"id":"d236e01a-ecc6-4764-a9ac-be89088fbb69","racine_id":"d236e01a-ecc6-4764-a9ac-be89088fbb69","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"Désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"1:05","credit":"Gustave Roussy · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"_MtZJsdr824"},"source":"Gustave Roussy","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-12T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-12","revision_le":"2027-10-12"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"d2b86bd4-ada9-4030-8364-dcab3939e408","racine_id":"d2b86bd4-ada9-4030-8364-dcab3939e408","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La désinfection des mains par friction hydro-alcoolique","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"2:00","credit":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"KFK7f8IMGe8"},"source":"Hôpital universitaire Robert-Debré","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-09T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-09","revision_le":"2027-10-09"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":2,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"e8a8282d-1217-490f-ba77-48232e1d7ff0","racine_id":"e8a8282d-1217-490f-ba77-48232e1d7ff0","version":1,"type":"video","titre":"La prévention des escarres","resume":null,"corps":{"duree":"4:17","credit":"ActuSoins (Julien Duvivier) · lue depuis YouTube, droits réservés à son auteur","youtube_id":"wSM3fHWvKgU"},"source":"ActuSoins (Julien Duvivier)","fiches":["SOINS_NURSING","PANSEMENT"],"tags":["escarre","prévention"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-09-09T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-09-09","revision_le":"2027-09-09"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":0,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[]},{"id":"1aa1f435-74e8-4c8f-9473-8228dccae8f8","racine_id":"1aa1f435-74e8-4c8f-9473-8228dccae8f8","version":1,"type":"question","titre":"Quelle hygiène des mains entre deux soins chez le même patient ?","resume":null,"corps":{},"source":"Contenu de démonstration · à valider par un référent","fiches":["PANSEMENT","INJECTION","SUIVI_DIABETIQUE","PARAMETRES_VITAUX","PRELEVEMENT","ANTICOAGULANT","MEDICAMENTS","SOINS_NURSING","PERFUSION_IV","PERFUSION_SC","STOMIE_DIGESTIVE","STOMIE_URINAIRE"],"tags":["hygiène"],"essentiel":false,"statut":"publie","a_revoir":false,"auteur":{"nom":"Paul Durand","qualite":"IDE"},"cree_le":"2026-10-27T07:40:49.034591+00:00","relu":{"par":"Claire Martin","le":"2026-10-19T16:00:00+00:00"},"validation":{"par":"Claire Martin","qualite":"IDE","le":"2026-10-19","revision_le":"2027-10-19"},"motif_refus":null,"vues":2,"utile":1,"mon_vote":false,"reponses":[{"id":"37d6534e-92e5-40d1-8f42-982c15bb58e3","texte":"Friction hydro-alcoolique avant et après chaque soin, y compris chez le même patient quand on passe d'un site contaminé (change, plaie) à un site propre (injection, cathéter), et après le retrait des gants. Lavage au savon doux seulement si l